请按时打印准考证，仔细查看</span><strong class="cjk"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; text-decoration: none; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">考点名称</span></strong><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; text-decoration: none; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">和</span><strong class="cjk"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; text-decoration: none; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">考点地址</span></strong><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: normal;"><span style="text-decoration: none; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-style: normal; font-size: 20px; font-weight: normal;">，</span><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">认真阅读准考证上的相关要求并严格执行，按照准考证上规定的时间和地点参加考试。</span></span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.95cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); break-after: auto; font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 20px;">2.</span><span style="font-size: 20px;"><strong class="cjk"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">入场出场有时限。</span></strong><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">考试开始前</span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 20px;">30</span><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-style: normal; font-size: 20px;">分钟，考生凭</span><span style="font-size: 20px;"><strong class="cjk"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">准考证</span></strong><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">和</span><strong class="cjk"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">身份证</span></strong><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">进入考场；考试开始</span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 20px;">30</span><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-style: normal; font-size: 20px;">分钟后，迟到考生不得入场；考试期间，考生不得提前交卷、退场。</span></p><p style="text-align: left; break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.95cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); break-after: auto; font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 20px;">3.</span><span style="font-size: 20px;"><strong class="cjk"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">个人物品要放妥。</span></strong><span style="font-size: 20px; font-variant: normal;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">考生</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;"><strong>严禁将手机、计算器、电子手表、智能手表、智能手环、智能眼镜、蓝牙耳机等各种电子、通信、计算、存储或其它设备、文字资料带至座位</strong></span></span><strong class="cjk"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">。</span></strong><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">手机须关闭报时和闹钟功能，关机后放在指定位置。考试期间凡发现将严禁携带的物品或设备带至座位的，一律按违规违纪相关规定处理。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.95cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); break-after: auto; font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 20px;">4.</span><span style="font-size: 20px;"><strong class="cjk"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">考场规则要遵守。</span></strong><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">考生</span><strong class="cjk"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">不得在考试开始信号发出前答题，考试结束铃响，考生应立即停止答题。</span></strong><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">考生交卷时应将试卷、答题卡分别翻放在桌面上，经监考人员清点允许后，方可离开考场。不得以任何理由将试卷、答题卡和草稿纸带出考场。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.95cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); break-after: auto; font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 20px;">5.</span><span style="font-size: 20px;"><strong class="cjk"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">考试作弊不可取。</span></strong><span style="font-size: 20px; font-variant: normal;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-style: normal; font-size: 20px; font-weight: normal;">考试作弊行为已入刑，</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal;">考生务必仔细阅读《中华人民共和国刑法修正案（九）》、《公务员录用违规违纪行为处理办法》（中组发〔</span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 20px;">2021</span><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-fami